      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: Krea 2 Anime-tuned Hybrid (Raw 2 steps -> Turbo 6 steps)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Krea 2 Anime-tuned Hybrid (Raw 2 steps -> Turbo 6 steps)\n\nModel: [ricecake/Krea-2-Anime-tuned-Raw](https://huggingface.co/ricecake/Krea-2-Anime-tuned-Raw)\n\n## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [krea2_anime_tuned_raw_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/ricecake/Krea-2-Anime-tuned-Raw/resolve/main/krea2_anime_tuned_raw_fp8_scaled.safetensors) (BF16 file and diffusers weights: see the model repo)\n\n**text_encoders** (Comfy-Org)\n\n- [qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) (4.88 GB)\n\n**vae** (Comfy-Org)\n\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors) (242 MB)\n\nMore Krea 2 files: [Hugging Face:Comfy-Org/Krea-2](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2), [ModelScope:Comfy-Org/Krea-2](https://modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/Krea-2)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n  models/\n    diffusion_models/\n      krea2_anime_tuned_raw_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n    text_encoders/\n      qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n    vae/\n      qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## Caption node (capgen)\n\n**Krea 2 Anime Caption (capgen)** turns Danbooru tags into a caption in the style of the training captions; its `caption` output is the prompt. Install the custom node from [github.com/ricecake000/ComfyUI-Krea2-Anime-Capgen](https://github.com/ricecake000/ComfyUI-Krea2-Anime-Capgen) (it downloads its data, ~445 MB, on first use). The **info** preview shows how each tag was understood. To write your own prompt instead, delete the capgen node and type into the positive text box.\n\nAuto-generated captions often contain \"white background\" and lean towards Danbooru rating s (roughly R-12 to R-15 content). Remove what you do not want with exclusions in the tags, e.g. `-white background`, `-simple background`, or exclude suggestive tags.\n\n## Sampler settings\n\nOne 8-step schedule, euler / simple, the same seed in both samplers (the **Seed** node). Steps 0-2: the **Raw** model, cfg 2.5, negative prompt = empty text. Steps 2-8: the **Turbo** model, cfg 1.0 (no CFG). Needs both fp8 files.\n\nBoth models go through **ModelSamplingFlux** with base_shift = max_shift = 1.15 (Turbo's fixed mu at every resolution), so both KSamplerAdvanced nodes compute the identical 8-step sigma table; the first runs steps 0-2 and returns the latent with its leftover noise, the second continues it from step 2 to 8 without adding noise. Change the resolution only with the **Width** / **Height** nodes: they feed both the latent and ModelSamplingFlux. Do not edit the shift values by hand (the UI rounds edits to 0.01).\n\n## Hybrid files\n\nBoth diffusion models are needed: `krea2_anime_tuned_raw_fp8_scaled.safetensors` from [ricecake/Krea-2-Anime-tuned-Raw](https://huggingface.co/ricecake/Krea-2-Anime-tuned-Raw) and `krea2_anime_tuned_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors` from [ricecake/Krea-2-Anime-tuned-Turbo](https://huggingface.co/ricecake/Krea-2-Anime-tuned-Turbo), both in `models/diffusion_models/`.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
